402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (The system must autonomously scan the OS process table at predefined micro-intervals without requiring any manual initiation or start commands. It must correctly and deterministically identify the absence of a registered target executable \(e.g., calc.exe or notepad.exe\) using precise string- matching algorithms against the kernel's active process list, actively avoiding false positives.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (Upon detection of an absence, the system must instantly trigger an OS-level restart command and wait a calculated duration for the graphical interface to render. The system must securely open, write to, and close SQLite database connections entirely within a single operational cycle to prevent multi- threading locks.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
