406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (The host machine must have Python 3.8 or higher installed, and the Python executable must be explicitly added to the system PATH environment variables to allow seamless execution from any directory.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (Crucially, the background script must be granted sufficient execution privileges. If triggered via Windows Task Scheduler or Linux Cron, the designated task must be configured to "Run with highest privileges" or run as sudo.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (Additionally, administrators must have the ability to click a single interface button to download the entirety of the historical shift ledger. This downloaded file must be generated dynamically in-memory and formatted as comma-separated values \(CSV\) through a dedicated HTTP endpoint, ensuring immediate compatibility with external auditing tools and enterprise ERP systems.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
