413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (The design of the AI Self-Healing Cloud abstracts the immense complexity of distributed cloud orchestration into a standalone, highly portable Python script.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (The High-Level Design focuses heavily on the unidirectional flow of telemetry and state data. Information originates as hardware interrupts in the OS kernel, flows into the Python Logic Engine where it is mathematically interpreted.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (A core tenet of this architecture is strict execution isolation. The monitoring engine is architecturally decoupled from the POS client applications it observes.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (Because the SRE daemon operates in a completely separate memory space and thread execution context from the retail applications, a fatal memory leak or crash in the client application will never cascade and crash the monitoring daemon.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
